# Runtime output from `visual-artifact create`.
# Keep this directory in the repo, but do not ship generated projects
# or sidecar assets. Checked-in contract 3 bundles are the published
# specs: <project>/<slug>/artifact.json.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
# A parent directory stays ignored until it is un-ignored, so nested
# artifact.json exceptions need these directory exceptions first.
!*/
!*/*/
!*/*/artifact.json
!visualizer/component-library.json
